# Rigid Token-Based Design System (ai-design-skills methodology)

## Colors (Light Theme Focus)
- App Background: `bg-slate-50`
- Surface (Sidebar, Cards, Tables, Modals): `bg-white`
- Primary (Pika Brand): `bg-purple-600` (active states, primary buttons), `text-purple-600`, `hover:bg-purple-700`
- Text - Primary Headings: `text-slate-900`
- Text - Secondary / Table Headers / Breadcrumbs / Captions: `text-slate-500`
- Borders: 1px solid `border-slate-200`
- Status - In-Stock: `text-emerald-500` / `bg-emerald-500` dot indicator
- Status - Out of stock: `text-red-500` / `bg-red-500` dot indicator

## Radius & Borders
- Cards & Containers: `rounded-xl` or `rounded-lg` with `border border-slate-200`. No excessive rounding.
- Buttons & Inputs: `rounded-lg`.
- Dropdowns & Modals: `rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white`.
- Shadows: Minimal to none; rely on crisp 1px solid `border-slate-200` rather than heavy drop shadows.

## Typography
- Font: Inter or system-sans.
- Page Headers: `text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900`.
- Section / Card Titles: `text-base font-semibold text-slate-900`.
- Table Data: `text-sm font-medium text-slate-900`.
- Secondary Data / Metas: `text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium`.

## Navigation & Layout
- Sidebar: Fixed or relative left bar, `w-64 bg-white border-r border-slate-200`.
- Active Nav Item: Solid Pika Purple block `bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 font-medium shadow-sm`.
- Inactive Nav Items: Muted `text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 font-medium`.
